<h1> Meanscoil Education </h1>

<h2> Meánscoil Nua an Leith Triúigh is dedicated to providing a high standard of education through the Irish language, supporting both academic achievement and personal development. The school offers a broad curriculum that encourages students to reach their full potential while fostering a strong sense of culture and identity. With committed teachers and a supportive learning environment, students are guided to develop critical thinking, independence, and a lifelong love of learning.
 </h2>

<h3>625 Points Achievements: In August 2025, students Carla Qualter and Patrick Harrington-Stack both achieved the maximum 625 points, with plans to study Engineering and Pharmacy.
Previous Top Achiever: Lucy Walsh achieved a perfect 625 points in 2018, including H1s in Higher Level Maths, Physics, Chemistry, D.C.G, Gaeilge and French, going on to study Engineering at UCD.</h3>







