<h1> Meanscoil Sports </h1>

<h2> Meánscoil Nua an Leith Triúigh has a strong tradition of promoting sport as an important part of student life. The school encourages participation in a wide range of activities, particularly Gaelic games like football and hurling, which are central to the local community. Students are given opportunities to develop teamwork, fitness, and discipline through regular training and competition. With supportive coaches and a focus on inclusion, sport at the school helps build confidence and school spirit among pupils. </h2>
